msgid "Exports every posted journal line for the selected fiscal year as a DATEV Buchungsstapel EXTF file. Requires a DATEV consultant number, client number, and a DATEV account number on every account referenced by a posted entry — configure these under Accounting → Chart of Accounts and Organization settings."
